    "solution": "Drop into the well and upward-cut the seed so it rises into the upper travel channel. Climb back up the west face, wall-jump over the relocated seed, then brake and fall on its east side. Face the seed and cut left for a flat rightward launch. Let that arc cross the first part of the gulf, then use the saved diagonal dash to lift the inherited speed onto the far shelf.",
